It would be useful to know whether a Ph.D. course on applied spatial data analysis held in Bergen, Norway, in early December 2012 would be of interest to list subscribers or others known to you. The course description, and details of the Spring 2011 edition are available here:

http://www.nhh.no/no/studentsider/faginformasjon/studier-ved-nhh-(studieh%C3%A5ndboken)/studieh%C3%A5ndboken.aspx?Kurs=ECS530

http://www.nhh.no/en/research---faculty/department-of-economics/phd-pages/phd-courses/ecs530-analysing-spatial-data.aspx

Indications of interest at this stage are not binding, but would be useful in deciding whether to offer the course in 2012 or 2013.

Grateful for feedback off-list,

Roger

